catflow 0.8
1. Read Text   prompts.txt
2. Split       by=lines   text -> [text]
3. <each compare_one>   [text] -> [text]
     1. <list system_a>   (input:1)
          1. Draft   Qwen3 8B; "Say hello in one short sentence."
     2. <list system_b>   (input:1)
          1. Draft   Qwen3 8B; "Say hello in one short sentence."
     3. Judge      (input:1,1,2)   Qwen3 8B; "Which better answers the prompt?
                                   tags: a, b"
        -> { a: 4 | b: 5 }
     4. Template                   "A"
        -> 6
     5. Template                   "B"
     6. Template                   "{1}"
4. Filter      contains="A"
5. Count       items
6. Template    "A preferred on {1} cases — expand row 3 for details"
7. Save Text   ab-report.md
